msgid "Choose one method."
msgstr "选择一种方式。"

msgid "=== \"Standard pip wheel\""
msgstr "=== \"普通 pip wheel\""

msgid "!!! warning \"Standard pip installation currently supports Atlas A2 only\""
msgstr "!!! warning \"普通 pip 安装当前仅支持 Atlas A2\""

msgid ""
"The current standard PyPI `vllm-ascend` wheel is built for **Atlas A2**. It "
"does not automatically support Atlas A3, Atlas 300I DUO, Atlas 200I Pro, or "
"Atlas 950DT."
msgstr ""
"当前普通 PyPI `vllm-ascend` wheel 构建面向 **Atlas A2**，不能自动覆盖\n"
"            Atlas A3、Atlas 300I DUO、Atlas 200I Pro 或 Atlas 950DT。"

msgid ""
"For non-A2 hardware, use a pre-built image, WheelNext, or a source "
"installation."
msgstr "非 A2 硬件请使用预构建镜像、WheelNext 或源码安装。"

msgid "Check the installed device build:"
msgstr "检查已安装的 device build："

msgid "=== \"uv-wheelnext\""
msgstr "=== \"uv-wheelnext\""

msgid ""
"WheelNext selects a vLLM Ascend wheel that matches the hardware from a "
"variant repository."
msgstr "WheelNext 用于从 variant repository 中选择匹配硬件的 vLLM Ascend wheel。"

msgid "First, install and verify `uv`:"
msgstr "先安装并验证 `uv`："

msgid "Install vLLM:"
msgstr "安装 vLLM："

msgid "Install the vLLM Ascend variant:"
msgstr "安装 vLLM Ascend variant："

msgid "Check the device build:"
msgstr "检查 device build："

msgid "??? warning \"Known dependency metadata conflict\""
msgstr "??? warning \"已知依赖 metadata 冲突\""

msgid ""
"The current release wheel combination may declare inconsistent PyTorch "
"versions for vLLM and vLLM Ascend, causing the final `pip check` to report a"
" conflict."
msgstr ""
"当前 release wheel 组合可能存在 vLLM 与 vLLM Ascend 对 PyTorch\n"
"            版本声明不一致的问题，导致最终 `pip check` 报告冲突。"

msgid ""
"If you need a fully consistent and reproducible dependency environment, use "
"a **pre-built vLLM Ascend image** or a **source installation**."
msgstr ""
"如果你需要完全一致、可复现的依赖环境，优先使用：\n"
"            **预构建 vLLM Ascend 镜像** 或 **源码安装**。"

msgid "=== \"Source installation\""
msgstr "=== \"源码安装\""

msgid ""
"This method is intended for users who need to modify Python/C++/kernel code "
"or build the environment in release dependency order."
msgstr "适用于需要修改 Python/C++/kernel 代码，或希望按发布依赖顺序构建环境的用户。"

msgid "Install the base tools:"
msgstr "安装基础工具："

msgid "=== \"Ubuntu / Debian\""
msgstr "=== \"Ubuntu / Debian\""

msgid "=== \"openEuler / RHEL-like\""
msgstr "=== \"openEuler / RHEL-like\""

msgid "Clone the matching versions:"
msgstr "拉取匹配版本："

msgid "Install the vLLM Ascend requirements first, then install vLLM:"
msgstr "先安装 vLLM Ascend requirements，再安装 vLLM："

msgid ""
"In environments that support Triton Ascend, install the version specified in"
" `requirements.txt` last:"
msgstr "对支持 Triton Ascend 的环境，最后按 `requirements.txt` 中的版本安装："

msgid "!!! note \"Atlas 300I DUO / Atlas 200I Pro\""
msgstr "!!! note \"Atlas 300I DUO / Atlas 200I Pro\""

msgid ""
"For paths that do not support Triton/Triton Ascend, do not install the "
"Triton combination above:"
msgstr "对不支持 Triton/Triton Ascend 的路径，不安装上述 Triton 组合："

msgid "After installation, run:"
msgstr "安装完成后："

msgid ""
"Resolve any additional conflicts involving vLLM, vLLM Ascend, PyTorch, "
"TorchNPU, or Triton Ascend before proceeding to the Quickstart."
msgstr ""
"对任何涉及 vLLM、vLLM Ascend、PyTorch、TorchNPU 或 Triton Ascend 的\n"
"        额外冲突，都应先处理后再进入 Quickstart。"
